\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 \strokec2 Part 3\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 Facilitator:
\f1\b0  Do those anxious spikes still happen now?\

\f0\b Participant:
\f1\b0  Yes, they do. But now I have a tool\'97to protect my energy and inner peace. Lately I\'92m practicing boundaries, ignoring provocations.\
Before, I\'92d argue and explain; now I respond neutrally or not at all. I\'92ve noticed the change\'97even he\'92s calmer now and agrees with some of my boundaries.\
Today, something small triggered me again. He said he was going to the climbing gym, and I felt like I wasn\'92t his priority. The old pattern started\'97wanting to do something to get his attention\'97but I caught myself and stayed in my lane.\

\f0\b Facilitator:
\f1\b0  It sounds like you understand the \'93rules of the game,\'94 and choosing not to play gives you peace. You still feel the pattern, but you see it clearly.\

\f0\b Participant:
\f1\b0  Yes. I\'92m learning to stay neutral and choose myself.\
