\f0\b Participant:
\f1\b0  Definitely. I\'92m at a stage where I 
\f2\i want
\f1\i0  help, where I\'92m open to it. I used to reject advice; now I listen\'97even to strangers sometimes\'97and test what works for me.\

\f0\b Facilitator:
\f1\b0  What kind of approach or message would get your attention?\

\f0\b Participant:
\f1\b0  Something spiritual but also grounded\'97about God, but with psychological clarity too. I like when science meets spirituality. I\'92m also curious about nontraditional tools\'97psychedelic journeys, deep self-exploration. Ideally, something that nourishes both mind and soul.\

\f0\b Facilitator:
\f1\b0  Have you tried breathwork before?\

\f0\b Participant:
\f1\b0  Yes\'97actually through ChatGPT. I learned how breath can calm the nervous system: inhale, hold, exhale, repeat. Doing it alone is hard because of my baby, but I do it 
\f2\i with
\f1\i0  her sometimes.\
Co-regulation really works\'97when I calm myself, she calms down too. Kids mirror our nervous system; they can feel if we\'92re genuinely relaxed or faking it.\

\f0\b Facilitator:
\f1\b0  So short 5\'9610 minute practices fit better into your rhythm?\

\f0\b Participant:
\f1\b0  Yes. It has to be quick and accessible. The world moves fast\'97if it takes too long, people reach for cigarettes or something worse.\
If it\'92s an app or audio, I want instant access. No complicated setup.\

\f0\b Facilitator:
\f1\b0  Would you prefer a structured course or something more intuitive\'97choose by feeling?\

\f0\b Participant:
\f1\b0  The best would be an interface where I can tell it how I feel\'97like \'93I\'92m angry,\'94 \'93I\'92m sad,\'94 \'93I\'92m anxious\'94\'97and it suggests what to do right away. Like ChatGPT for emotions. It feels like I\'92m heard and supported in the moment.\
Often, even with music, I know I need 
\f2\i something
\f1\i0 , but not what exactly. So a tool that can \'93read\'94 that and guide me\'97that\'92s gold.\

\f0\b Facilitator:
\f1\b0  In an audio experience, what\'92s most important to you\'97the voice, the music, or the content?\

\f0\b Participant:
\f1\b0  Depends on the situation, but usually the 
\f2\i voice
\f1\i0 . I want a real person guiding me\'97simple, clear, calm, \'93doing it with me.\'94 Reading an instruction is hard; I want someone leading in real time, maybe with sound cues.\
